STR_GRF_NAME :Hunninghall Grand City Metropolitan Airport 1.0
STR_GRF_DESC :Classic copper-roof terminal. Separate arrival and departure runways, three stands. Replaces the default metropolitan airport. Original aircraft movement and airside layout retained. Available from 1960.
